OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Conservative MP admits
OL,4,Aassaulting man
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Conservative MP has pleaded
OL,7,Fguilty to assaulting a man.
OL,9,FBen Howlett, from Greenwich in London,
OL,10,Fhas admitted the offence, which took
OL,11,Fplace in Battersea on 25 June 2021.
OL,13,FHe represented Bath in Somerset from
OL,14,F2015 until May 2017, when Parliament
OL,15,Fwas dissolved ahead of the general
OL,16,Felection. He then formally lost his
OL,17,Fseat on 8 June 2017.
OL,19,FHowlett is due to be sentenced for
OL,20,Fassault by beating at Kingston Crown
OL,21,FCourt in London on 10 December.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
